      "message": "docs(examples): add README and align bolt12 example with Makefile port (#650)\n\n- Add examples/README.md covering how to run each demo, the top-level\n  Makefile targets for spinning up local mints, and per-example mint\n  requirements.\n- Update bolt12Wallet_example.ts MINT_URL from :8085 to :3338 so it\n  works out-of-the-box with the standard `DEV=1 make cdk-up` flow.\n  The 8085 port pre-dated the Makefile and had no technical reason.",
