      "message": "fix(mint): treat null amount on BOLT12 mint quote as no-amount (#649)\n\n* fix(mint): treat null amount on BOLT12 mint quote as no-amount\n\nPer NUT-25 the BOLT12 mint quote `amount` field is <int|null>; null\nmeans an amountless offer. CDK emits explicit null on the wire.\nnormalizeMintQuoteBolt12Fields was checking `=== undefined` only, so\nthe call fell through to `Amount.from(null)` which throws\n\"Unsupported amount input type\" — breaking every BOLT12 amountless\nmint quote against CDK.\n\nTreat null and undefined alike (Postel-style), matching the spec\nintent and matching how other nullable wire fields are handled.\nAdds a regression test pinning the new behaviour.\n\n* refactor(utils): add nullIfUndefined/undefinedIfNull helpers",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "3c6705ba00042e1a3d4aa526aab29d23b0f21368",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cashu-ts/git/trees/3c6705ba00042e1a3d4aa526aab29d23b0f21368"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cashu-ts/git/commits/067b38d530d2a43f62b1c2b8ea7308976d6a0c6e",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/eoMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3XUQAKFp19h5ObTGGL7gCQuMH39o\nt5iWjdjpelvwU6snBAx/g1e9r7P2HQEKzYQQ7Hbe4ZjjKAmzwpbdPSrIGgW9Nwqp\ne5VvPdQpn4nTmXtA8zZ3e4uJbNllArgTBFlrBKS+wWWxVOfeCnSVKeMWi122ZCKT\naDr2D61nwk+inkrLnhsOafbLL4O2S1vdQxacMUCbF2FinJSbUA4SZGUsri85tFkQ\nhLGZs2XYpP386o0aFmp3RV9tTfoSjD1uxhvAJcpn8GYFqtNoQqHqJmLKvwKjoqwv\nUi5j1g3t/SKEb8eTfLsHov5BJluq6t0lKhN/nPArdvMjYrSaCH0roiEBrbGSBK9R\naSfKXoiEDvvcJj6Bmsjg1466DVju9Ur7QY2Mx9wN+YAbMtDRCpJ69BhnitmlZPqI\nT1r4gzVRL1+JI1w1iNrV1S57fa6m8ZkIESemBMWYVRj+uNeQnTNSINERGfNB8ar3\nOWdEXSkAT7M6Awgtqpu/T1xCzg0Tew6OJ0u1+fYLpsWyzsbC1Cge9p6cMX2pSQJU\ntaSvfUXtsEnlsRzgRFMgh8/fFlogTEEC8wN6iYbfDY43Z6zbnL1TcHXiK5YwnCtK\nJc1414ZgoBcIECIuh8zOrcqUZEHIFIFitJVbdQYwy/EgHjzzclssLFnaIUyS339h\nXGb/dempS2KfrvHgQazS\n=PteG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 3c6705ba00042e1a3d4aa526aab29d23b0f21368\nparent b55e064aa886f1ca79f18cc8903ffd7535295ded\nauthor Rob Woodgate <robwoodgate@users.noreply.github.com> 1778248204 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778248204 +0100\n\nfix(mint): treat null amount on BOLT12 mint quote as no-amount (#649)\n\n* fix(mint): treat null amount on BOLT12 mint quote as no-amount\n\nPer NUT-25 the BOLT12 mint quote `amount` field is <int|null>; null\nmeans an amountless offer. CDK emits explicit null on the wire.\nnormalizeMintQuoteBolt12Fields was checking `=== undefined` only, so\nthe call fell through to `Amount.from(null)` which throws\n\"Unsupported amount input type\" — breaking every BOLT12 amountless\nmint quote against CDK.\n\nTreat null and undefined alike (Postel-style), matching the spec\nintent and matching how other nullable wire fields are handled.\nAdds a regression test pinning the new behaviour.\n\n* refactor(utils): add nullIfUndefined/undefinedIfNull helpers",
        "verified_at": "2026-05-08T13:50:05Z"
      }
